{"id":"645423","name":"蒜香烤贝南瓜","author":"红•宏","authorId":"10737312","desc":"","cover":"images/645423/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"贝贝南瓜","amount":"1个"}],"sub":[{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"大蒜","amount":"6粒"},{"name":"橄榄油","amount":"1勺"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"贝贝南瓜洗干净取瓤切成八块，放盆里里面加盐。","img":"images/645423/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"加一勺橄榄油。","img":"images/645423/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"大蒜洗干净切成蒜末放进去。","img":"images/645423/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加黑胡椒粉带厨房一次性收到抓拌入味。","img":"images/645423/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放进烤箱180°20分钟。","img":"images/645423/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"蒜香浓郁，香甜软糯的烤南瓜出锅。","img":"images/645423/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"好吃。","img":"images/645423/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"太好吃了。","img":"images/645423/step_8.jpg"}],"tips":"不喜欢吃蒜的可以不放。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：烤箱\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}